# Request one coordinated dual-arm harvest task.
#
# Stage flow: APPROACH -> PICK -> RETREAT -> HOME (v1; END_EFFECTOR/PLACE/
# RELEASE stages are reserved but skipped unless enabled in config).
#
# Either arm may be disabled for split verification; the enabled arms of every
# stage are planned together, dispatched with one shared start time, and must
# all succeed before the next stage starts.
# Goal
double_arm_harvest_interfaces/HarvestTarget left_target
double_arm_harvest_interfaces/HarvestTarget right_target
bool execute_left
bool execute_right
---
# Result
bool success
bool left_success
bool right_success
# Stage name of the first failure, e.g. "APPROACH"; empty on success
string failed_stage
string message
---
# Feedback
string left_stage
string right_stage
# Fraction of enabled motion stages completed for that arm, [0, 1]
float32 left_progress
float32 right_progress
string message
